Hey,
v. 0.1.1 is live! Here's the changes:


 Added icons on the map for the Mailbox and the Trader. This will help new players to navigate in the game;
 Key game mechanics like Chest, Trader will be displayed for the first time;
 The guide boy speaks 2 times slower;
 Fixed some bugs that could lead to a guide softlock;
 Added keybinding panel in Settings Menu.


Happy brewing!
